+    Each path can also be specified as a tuple ``(path, priority)`` where
+    ``priority`` is an integer. Paths with higher priority are searched first.
+    Ordinary paths have a priority of 0. The searchpath is sorted by descending
+    priority before being stored. Entries with the same priority retain their
+    input order (stable sort).
+
+    .. code-block:: python
+
+        loader = FileSystemLoader([
+            ("/user/templates", 10),
+            "/default/templates",
+            ("/system/templates", -5)
+        ])
+
     :param searchpath: A path, or list of paths, to the directory that
